    "intro_narrative": "You wake up in the dimly lit office of a renowned but missing private investigator. Dust motes dance in the pale light filtering through the blinds. The detective was close to solving a massive conspiracy, and the agency believes he left his final findings hidden within this very room. Time is running out before the perpetrators realize you are here. Your objective is to piece together his scattered tools, uncover the hidden evidence, and expose the truth before the shadowy syndicate returns to silence you for good.",
    "narrative_style": "mystery"
  },
